    F["<b>FREE - Comply</b><br/>under 20 employees - &#8377;0<br/>size gate at the EPF line, never a feature gate<br/>payroll computation incl. ESI and TDS<br/>generated artefacts - the customer submits"]:::free
    B["<b>FILE - beachhead, 20 to 199</b><br/>target &#8377;80 to 150 PEPM - Hypothesis<br/>actual headcount, no seat floor - P6<br/>registration allowance plus multi-registration line - EV-088<br/>portal-accepted artefacts plus attended submission, under SLA<br/>operator route under written authority once counsel clears"]:::core
